===Final===
[[File:Ruslana Eurovision 2005 final.jpg|thumb|upright|Ruslana performing at the opening of the final]]
The finalists were:
*the four automatic qualifiers {{Esccnty|France|y=2005}}, {{Esccnty|Germany|y=2005}}, {{Esccnty|Spain|y=2005}}, and the {{Esccnty|United Kingdom|y=2005}};
*the top 10 countries from the [[Eurovision Song Contest 2004#Final|2004 final]] (other than the automatic qualifiers);
*the top 10 countries from the 2005 semi-final.

The final was held on 21 May 2005 at 22:00 EEST (21:00 CEST) and was won by {{Esccnty|Greece|y=2005}}. 24 countries performed and all 39 participants voted.
