===Barbara Dex Award===
The [[Barbara Dex Award]] is a humorous fan award given to the worst dressed artist each year. Named after [[Barbara Dex]] who came last for {{esccnty|Belgium|y=1993|t=Belgium in 1993}}, wearing her self-designed dress, the award was handed by the fansite House of Eurovision from 1997 to 2016 and is being carried out by the fansite songfestival.be since 2017.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.eurovisionhouse.nl/bdaward.php|title=Barbara Dex Award|last=van Thillo|first=Edwin|access-date=24 June 2014|url-status=dead|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160507232212/http://www.eurovisionhouse.nl/bdaward.php|archive-date=7 May 2016}}</ref>
